<title>OMAN: Oman's Areej 96 net profit sharply lower.</title>
<headline>Oman's Areej 96 net profit sharply lower.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			 (Omani rials)</p>
<p> Net profit		    144,471  vs    303,432</p>
<p> Turnover		   11,290,821  vs 17,177,474</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		147,226  vs    308,176</p>
<p> Total proposed dividend   115,000  vs    376,000</p>
<p>Full Name: Areej Vegetable Oils and Derivatives SAOG.</p>
<p>Note: The board attributed the sharp drop in turnover and profits to a halt in imports of vegetable oils and ghee by Iran, its major client.</p>
</text>
